# LeakSanitizer suppressions for the test suites (LSAN_OPTIONS=suppressions=...).
#
# triton's worker threads: create_thread() (triton.c) allocates the thread
# descriptors in triton_run() and they are still reachable only through
# threads that are gone at exit. Not a product leak (thread bookkeeping that
# lives for the whole process); it is reported on every clean daemon exit.
# Matches this one allocation site only; any other leak is still reported.
leak:create_thread
